# CODEOWNERS
#
# This file defines code ownership for pull request reviews.
# Code owners are automatically requested for review when someone opens a pull request
# that modifies code that they own.
#
# Syntax:
#   pattern owner1 [owner2 ...]
#
# More specific patterns take precedence over less specific patterns.
#
# GitHub teams should be prefixed with @org/team-name
# Individual users should be prefixed with @username
#
# For this implementation, we use role-based placeholder owners.
# Replace with actual GitHub usernames or team names.

# ==============================================================================
# Default Owners
# ==============================================================================
# Default owners for everything in the repo (unless a later match takes precedence)
